- action(n1, "start the process"): Hallucinates an introductory step; the description states the process "starts with receiving a request for information", so init(i1) should connect directly to n2 without an intervening action.
- action(n5, "end of process"): Hallucinates a terminal step; the description states the process simply "comes to an end", so n4 should connect directly to end(e1).
- actor(a_default, "Default", [i1, n1, n2, n3, n4, n5, e1]): Misattributes responsibility; the source explicitly assigns the workflow to "the referee", not a generic "Default" actor.